:null},{"k":"7:127","t":"And the eminent among the people of Pharaoh said, \"Will you leave Moses and his people to cause corruption in the land and abandon you and your gods?\" [Pharaoh] said, \"We will kill their sons and keep their women alive; and indeed, we are subjugators over them.\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":127,"sd":null},{"k":"7:128","t":"Said Moses to his people, \"Seek help through Allāh and be patient. Indeed, the earth belongs to Allāh. He causes to inherit it whom He wills of His servants. And the [best] outcome is for the righteous.\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":128,"sd":null},{"k":"7:129","t":"They said, \"We have been harmed before you came to us and after you have come to us.\" He said, \"Perhaps your Lord will destroy your enemy and grant you succession in the land and see how you will do.\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":129,"sd":null},{"k":"7:130","t":"And We certainly seized the people of Pharaoh with years of famine and a deficiency in fruits that perhaps they would be reminded.","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":130,"sd":null}],"juz":9,"hizb":17,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":false}